question> How many previous applications were refused, and what percentage of all previous applications is that?
SQL: SELECT
  COUNT(SK_ID_PREV) * 100.0 / (
    SELECT
      COUNT(SK_ID_PREV)
    FROM previous_application
  )
FROM previous_application;
[ok] cols=['((count(SK_ID_PREV) * 100.0) / (SELECT count(SK_ID_PREV) FROM previous_application))']
   (100.0,)
Answer: ```sql
SELECT COUNT(SK_ID_PREV) * 100.0 / (SELECT COUNT(SK_ID_PREV) FROM previous_application)
FROM previous_application;
```
The percentage of previous applications that were refused is 100.0%.
